{"ref":"BDB, פֶּ֫לג","hw":"פֶּ֫לג","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּ֫לג</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 65:10\" href=\"/Psalms.65.10\">ψ 65:10</a> (cleft) <strong>channel</strong>, (artif.) <strong>canal</strong>;—usually pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּלָגִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.25\">Is 30:25</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">יִבְלֵי־מָ֑יִם</span>); cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">פַּלְגֵי־מַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 1:3\" href=\"/Psalms.1.3\">ψ 1:3</a>, sim. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.2\">Is 32:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 21:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.21.1\">Pr 21:1</a>, metaph. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.16\">5:16</a>, of tears <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:48\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.48\">La 3:48</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:136\" href=\"/Psalms.119.136\">ψ 119:136</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּלָגָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 46:5\" href=\"/Psalms.46.5\">ψ 46:5</a> (i.e. irrigating canals from river, metaph.); <span dir=\"rtl\">פַּלְגֵי־שָׁ֑מֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 29:6\" href=\"/Job.29.6\">Jb 29:6</a> (fig. of prosperity); sg. <span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּלֶג אֱלֹהִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 65:10\" href=\"/Psalms.65.10\">ψ 65:10</a>, poet. of channel for rain (cf. <a data-ref=\"Job 38:25\" href=\"/Job.38.25\">Jb 38:25</a>).","next":"BDB, פֶּ֫לֶג","prev":"BDB, פָּלַג"}